EESchema-LIBRARY Version 2.4
#encoding utf-8
# ACH-4MHz, manufacturer pin numbering: 1 NC, 4 case/GND, 5 output, 8 VCC
DEF ACH-4MHz Y 0 40 Y Y 1 F N
F0 "Y" 0 350 50 H V C CNN
F1 "ACH-4MHz" 0 250 50 H V C CNN
DRAW
S -300 200 300 -200 0 1 10 f
X NC 1 -500 0 200 R 40 40 1 1 N
X GND 4 0 -400 200 U 40 40 1 1 W
X OUT 5 500 0 200 L 40 40 1 1 O
X VCC 8 0 400 200 D 40 40 1 1 W
ENDDRAW
ENDDEF
#End Library
